Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Nearest Neighbors",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Find known data points that are nearest to the target and use only those to \
infer the value for the input point.\n",
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Logistic regression",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Fitting best linear combination of logistic sigmoid functions.\n",
 "\n",
 StyleBox["SupportVectorMachine",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Find the plane that best partitions the data. Repeat with further \
partitoning planes.\n",
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Random forest",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Construct a decision tree that repeatedly partitions the data. Do this \
repeatedly and chose the decision tree that gives the best predictive power.\n\
",
 "\n",
 StyleBox["NaiveBayes",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Uses Bayes theorem assuming features are ",
 StyleBox["independent.\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Neural Network",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 "Multi-layered regression."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.705644496635439*^9, 3.705644504564994*^9}, 
   3.7056445854331083`*^9, {3.708234042127789*^9, 
   3.708234056459587*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8fd2bca6-64a4-4657-98a6-\
a3a9ef2ed657"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

